                <pb facs="0689" n="587" xml:id="pg587"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Wilson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-10-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 29,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On Saturday, 31st, the King will create the department of colonies and appoint
                    Mr. Renkin minister for the colonies.</p>
                <p>On the same day will appear the royal decree provided in article 4 of annexation
                    treaty fixing the date of Belgian assumption of sovereignty over the Kongo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
